":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"57"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"68"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及来源证明已读；Corollary1.8和弱基理论Q加单句的统一算术化未独立重建"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致的固定原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_{L_A}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_{L_A}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}\">\\(\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> 为逻辑的空非逻辑公理集；采用本册固定句法编号和标准证明算术化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 4.6；第61页归于 Montague and Tarski (1957)。结论保证存在r.e.不可冗余公理化，不保证保留原公理的复杂度，也不说当前呈示本身不可冗余。</p>\n<p>源证明对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公理的有限合取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span>，有效取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q+\\chi\">\\(Q+\\chi\\)</span> 的 Gödel 固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\chi\">\\(G_\\chi\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"6fca065df2bf5fac\" href=\"?note=6fca065df2bf5fac\" title=\"67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness\">67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness</a>）。一致性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi\">\\(Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi\\)</span>，故逻辑不能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\to G_\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\to G_\\chi\\)</span>。原书 Theorem2.4 的内部推导给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi\\)</span>；Corollary1.8 的本质反身性又给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\)</span>，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash G_\\chi\">\\(T\\vdash G_\\chi\\)</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi\\)</span> 代入 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"1b2d614db2eb3b87\" href=\"?note=1b2d614db2eb3b87\" title=\"67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion\">67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion</a> 得结果；若理论有限，则可合取后删除冗余，直接有结论。</p>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q+\\chi\">\\(Q+\\chi\\)</span> 一般不含PA；不能直接套用本册只为PA扩张陈述的第二不完全性定理接口。原书相应内部推导及有限部分真证明已定位，但没有在本簇独立形式化，故保留证明依赖限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion","status":"resolved","id":"1b2d614db2eb3b87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"67