ep}(D,\\gamma)$ 及 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的 $\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-certified-proof","status":"resolved","id":"189f5355af0e487c","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的固定编号为 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_{L_A}$。每个出现的有效理论 $A$ 绑定 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的呈示 $E_A$；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$ 及 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的 $\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-representation","status":"resolved","id":"3fa0d0f598b791bc","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的固定编号为 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_{L_A}$。每个出现的有效理论 $A$ 绑定 [[67-df-certified-proof]] 的呈示 $E_A$；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$ 及 [[67-df-proof-representation]] 的 $\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"源证明对每个 $T$ 公理的有限合取 $\\chi$，有效取 $Q+\\chi$ 的 Gödel 固定点 $G_\\chi$（[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]）。一致性给出 $Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi$，故逻辑不能证明 $\\chi\\to G_\\chi$。原书 Theorem2.4 的内部推导给 $\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi$；Corollary1.8 的本质反身性又给 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}$，因此 $T\\vdash G_\\chi$。将 $\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi$ 代入 [[67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]] 得结果；若理论有限，则可合取后删除冗余，直接有结论。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"6fca065df2bf5fac","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"源证明对每个 $T$ 公理的有限合取 $\\chi$，有效取 $Q+\\chi$ 的 Gödel 固定点 $G_\\chi$（[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]）。一致性给出 $Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi$，故逻辑不能证明 $\\chi\\to G_\\chi$。原书 Theorem2.4 的内部推导给 $\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi$；Corollary1.8 的本质反身性又给 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}$，因此 $T\\vdash G_\\chi$。将 $\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi$ 代入 [[67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]] 得结果；若理论有限，则可合取后删除冗余，直接有结论。","embed":false},{"target":"67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion","status":"resolved","id":"1b2d614db2eb3b87","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"源证明对每个 $T$ 公理的有限合取 $\\chi$，有效取 $Q+\\chi$ 的 Gödel 固定点 $G_\\chi$（[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]、[[67-thm-godel-first-incompleteness]]）。一致性给出 $Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi$，故逻辑不能证明 $\\chi\\to G_\\chi$。原书 Theorem2.4 的内部推导给 $\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi$；Corollary1.8 的本质反身性又给 $T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}$，因此 $T\\vdash G_\\chi$。将 $\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi$ 代入 [[67-lem-irredundant-axiomatization-criterion]] 得结果；若理论有限，则可合取后删除冗余，直接有结论。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_{L_A}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"g=c_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"E_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"Q+\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"Q+\\chi\\nvdash G_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi\\to G_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}+\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}\\vdash G_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{Q+\\chi}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash G_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi\\mapsto G_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"Q+\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":3297,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1b